OL,3,GNEWSANew chapter begins in Hinkley
OL,4,APoint B decommissioning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new chapter has begun at Hinkley
OL,7,FPoint B as the former nuclear power
OL,8,Fstation enters an 85-year
OL,9,Fdecommissioning programme.
OL,11,FThe Somerset site stopped generating
OL,12,Felectricity in 2022 after nearly 46
OL,13,Fyears and has been transferred from EDF
OL,14,Fto the Nuclear Restoration Services
OL,15,F(NRS), which will oversee it
OL,16,Fdismantling.
OL,18,FThe move will see about 250 workers
OL,19,Ftransfer to the organisation, including
OL,20,Fsome from families who have worked at
OL,21,FHinkley for generations.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
