OL,3,GNEWSANew chapter begins in Hinkley
OL,4,APoint B decommissioning
OL,5,
OL,6,FNRS is also decommissioning
OL,7,Fneighbouring Hinkley Point A and CEO
OL,8,FRob Fletcher said "we look forward to
OL,9,Fworking together across both sites" to
OL,10,F"deliver safe, secure decommissioning
OL,11,Ffor the benefit of the community".
